e free time).</div> </div> </div> </div>Just use Imgur. It's free and doesn't require registration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T07:24:53-08:00","id":1013740,"title":"","content":"That Fenrir doesn't have nearly enough battle scars or evil eyes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T07:28:22-08:00","id":1013745,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1013304-lupus-photographs?p=1013591#post1013591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now admittedly, some aren't perfect. But these are some of the ones I have that I liked.<br /> For the Striders I have a pic that's a jackal/wolf hybrid, but I much prefer to use the Ethiopian wolves for them. I really like the Silverfang one. I've got some other Bone Gnawer ones, but I like the dingo hybrid. Fianna being reddish coated wolves are easy enough. Actual red wolves though are kind of small (relatively speaking) and so I generally don't use them for Garou lupus form pics. Wendigo was easy enough to find timber wolves. Shadow Lords are kind of a pain since actual full black wolves are kind of rare, and generally not completely wolf blooded. It's a game though and so realism takes a back seat to coolness.<br /> <br /> Oh, and the Glasswalker wolf pic just looks so fancy, I couldn't picture it being another tribe <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah. It's a game so realism should take a back seat to cool. Also, there is a mystical element to Pure Breed that can't be seen though photographs. A Shadow Lord and a Black Fury may look similar, but a Garou would know which tribe they were when the meet them. Apparently Pure Breed doesn't really take hold until after the Rite of Passage. If a Garou doesn't choose the tribe of their ancestors, they lose the Pure Breed. I head canon all cubs have ratty coats and as Cliath they &quot;grow&quot; into their Pure Breed looks.<br /> <br /> Also, I did some reading on black wolves and the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_wolf\" target=\"_blank\">dark coat gene</a> is one Dogs gave back to them. When your Silver Fang calls her Shadow Lord rival a dog, she may be right. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","